<title>UK: Aston Villa scores on market debut.</title>
<headline>Aston Villa scores on market debut.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Aston Villa Plc kicked off at a premium to their flotation price on Wednesday as the Premier League club became the latest team to float on the London Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The shares, issued at 11.00 stg, gained 50p to 11.50 stg by 1043 GMT.</p>
<p>Dealers said two agency cross trades - where a brokerage matches a buy and sell order from different clients - had been executed at 11.75 stg, a premium of 75p, and had accounted for about 100,000 shares of the 136,000 volume recorded.</p>
<p>-- Andrew Langlands, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
